    {
      "text": "Joseph … was minded to put her away, Matt. 1:19. light a candle, and put it under a bushel, Matt. 5:15 (3 Ne. 12:15). Whosoever shall put away his wife, Matt. 5:31 (Luke 16:18; 3 Ne. 12:31–32). for your body, what ye shall put on, Matt. 6:25 (Luke 12:22; 3 Ne. 13:25). Is it lawful for a man to put away his wife, Matt. 19:3. let not man put asunder, Matt. 19:6 (Mark 10:9). I have no man … to put me into the pool, John 5:7. word of God … but seeing ye put it from you, Acts 13:46. put ye on the Lord Jesus Christ, Rom. 13:14. let not the husband put away his wife, 1 Cor. 7:11. when he shall have put down all rule, 1 Cor. 15:24. baptized into Christ have put on Christ, Gal. 3:27. That ye put off … the old man, Eph. 4:22 (Col. 3:9). put on the new man, Eph. 4:24 (Col. 3:10). Put on the whole armour of God, Eph. 6:11 (D&C 27:15). Put on … bowels of mercies, Col. 3:12. to be put in trust with the gospel, 1 Thes. 2:4. putting on the breastplate of faith, 1 Thes. 5:8. put away sin by the sacrifice of himself, Heb. 9:26.",
